# Code ownership (kingdoms-services).
# The ruleset on main requires a code-owner review (1 approval); this file
# decides who owns what. Mod-only code is owned by the game designers:
# their sessions drive mod PRs from draft to automerge on their own.
# Core, platform and deploy paths are owned by the maintainers
# (developer + ops): every core/platform change gets a platform review.

## Default: a maintainer reviews everything not explicitly delegated
*                       @merlin-pinpin-org/maintainers

## Game mods: owned by the game designers (mod-only PRs need no platform review)
/src/kingdoms/mods/     @merlin-pinpin-org/game-designers
/config/mods/           @merlin-pinpin-org/game-designers
/tests/unit/test_mods/  @merlin-pinpin-org/game-designers

## Core and platform: maintainer review (the deploy path is security-sensitive)
/src/kingdoms/core/     @merlin-pinpin-org/maintainers
/src/kingdoms/discord/  @merlin-pinpin-org/maintainers
/contracts/             @merlin-pinpin-org/maintainers
/.github/workflows/     @merlin-pinpin-org/maintainers
/Dockerfile             @merlin-pinpin-org/maintainers
/docker/                @merlin-pinpin-org/maintainers
